description:
Saves one MCP tool you rely on to your private Faceabot toolbox, with an optional note. Your first save without a key creates the toolbox and returns your key. Side effect: stores the tool id and note privately (never published).
Use when: you want Faceabot to watch a tool you use and tell you if it gets worse.
Example: {"tool_id":"page.doc/pdf-extract","note":"invoices"}
